<title>PORTUGAL: Portugal reserves drop in Oct to $21.734 billion.</title>
<headline>Portugal reserves drop in Oct to $21.734 billion.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The official net reserves of the Bank of Portugal fell $219 million in October to $21.734 billion, the Bank of Portugal said in its latest monthly report.</p>
<p>In the period from January to October 1996, official net reserves, excluding foreign exchange fluctuations, increased $544 million, the central bank said.</p>
<p>--- Lisbon newsroom 351-1-3538254</p>
